<title>USA: International Meta names Hoevel president.</title>
<headline>International Meta names Hoevel president.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Meta Systems Inc Tuesday named Lee Hoevel to the position of president.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said George Smith, formerly president, will remain chief executive officer and chairman.</p>
<p>The company said Hoevel has been a consultant for the company for the past five months identifying future opportunities and assisting in the development of leading-edge technologies.</p>
